et.png"},{"type":"专属","name":"特权决策","text":"选择1个特权决策颁布，对所有玩家生效，并且自己额外享受特权效果。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-r18/exclusive.png"}]},{"id":"commander-r4","name":"香香","avatar":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-r4/avatar.png","skillName":"究极弩炮","skillText":"开战时，香香会使用武器攻击敌人。\n香香初始攻击力为20，每拥有1名不低于10级的1-3阶英雄，香香的攻击力+20。","skills":[{"type":"技能","name":"究极弩炮","text":"开战时，香香会使用武器攻击敌人。\n香香初始攻击力为20，每拥有1名不低于10级的1-3阶英雄，香香的攻击力+20。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-r4/skill.png"},{"type":"秘技","name":"枪炮艺术","text":"累积造成10/15/20/30点棋手伤害，获得1张秘技牌武器改造。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/shared/secret.png"},{"type":"专属","name":"火力全开","text":"香香获得（己方英雄等级的总和×0.5）%的攻击力提升。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-r4/exclusive.png"}]},{"id":"commander-angel","name":"安琪拉","avatar":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-angel/avatar.jpg","skillName":"特制灵异追踪器","skillText":"获得飞行器，棋手等级达到3时获得1张顿悟时刻。","skills":[{"type":"技能","name":"特制灵异追踪器","text":"获得飞行器，棋手等级达到3时获得1张顿悟时刻。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-angel/skill.png"},{"type":"秘技","name":"驱鬼!加大力度!","text":"累积获得5/10/20/35点神秘力量，获得1张秘技牌灵异探测大改装。\n首次秘技只会从“上强度”“坐火箭”“定向毁灭”模块中随机选择其中2个。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/shared/secret.png"},{"type":"专属","name":"超级连接","text":"获得一张灵异探测大改装。战斗开始时，飞行器连接的英雄会随机获得自身10%-30%等级数的临时等级。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-angel/exclusive.png"}]},{"id":"commander-wufeng","name":"武凤","avatar":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-wufeng/avatar.jpg","skillName":"门庭赫奕","skillText":"比赛开始时额外拥有3能量；每次拍卖后，再次获得3能量。","skills":[{"type":"技能","name":"门庭赫奕","text":"比赛开始时额外拥有3能量；每次拍卖后，再次获得3能量。","icon":"https://static.datatft.com/wxq/wxq-database/commanders/commander-wufeng/skill.webp"},{"type":"秘技","na